  "description": "The school movie club has devolved into a support group for broken hearts. The only one holding it together? Club president Ban Ha-ri—a cold, no-nonsense realist who thinks romance is a complete waste of time. But when the club faces immediate shutdown, a miracle newcomer joins to save the day. The catch? It’s the exact same \"first love\" who completely wrecked her heart and vanished four years ago. Lights, camera... chaos!\n\n[Original webtoon](https://m.comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854366)",
